<title>YUGOSLAVIA: Yugoslav Feb industry output rises 1.9 pct.</title>
<headline>Yugoslav Feb industry output rises 1.9 pct.</headline>
<dateline>BELGRADE 1997-03-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Federal Statistical Office reported the following economic indicator details.</p>
<p> YUGOSLAV INDUSTRIAL OUTPUT   FEB	   JAN	FEB 1996</p>
<p> pct change mth/mth	   + 1.9	 - 20.8     + 5.1</p>
<p> pct change yr/yr	     +31.1	 +  2.9     + 6.4</p>
<p> index (base average 1996) +117.7	 + 87.8    +101.0</p>
<p>CUMULATIVE DATA (JAN TO FEB)</p>
<p> pct change yr/yr	     + 32.8		     + 8.0</p>
<p>NOTE - Data largely exclude private sector, where manufacturing is not significant. Data cover Federal Republic of Yugoslavia, comprising Serbia and Montenegro.</p>
<p>-- Gordana Kukic, Belgrade Newsroom ++381 11 222 4254</p>
